    "sections": {
        "description": "The Business Classified Ads theme is a dynamic, modern, and user-friendly platform designed for online classifieds websites, including buy-and-sell ads, local classifieds, free classifieds, premium listings, job classifieds, real estate listings, car classifieds, furniture classifieds, pet classifieds, and other niche-specific categories, providing a versatile solution for businesses, entrepreneurs, and individuals. With its clean, responsive, and mobile-friendly design, the theme ensures seamless browsing across desktops, tablets, and smartphones while offering visually appealing sections for ad categories, image galleries, featured listings, and call-to-action buttons to boost engagement and conversions. Built with secure, optimized code and Bootstrap framework, it supports advanced features such as ad posting, search filters, user registration, membership plans, and monetization options, making it easy to scale and manage a vibrant online marketplace. The theme is SEO-friendly, cross-browser compatible, and integrates smoothly with popular plugins like WP Job Manager for job listings, WooCommerce for paid ad packages, and Contact Form 7 for inquiries, enabling a professional, functional, and high-performing classifieds platform."
    },
